th was in its onboard technology.","words":[["Its",198.47,198.75],["strength",198.75,199.17],["was",199.17,199.79],["in",199.79,200.35],["its",200.35,200.53],["onboard",200.53,201.13],["technology.",201.13,201.97]]},{"start":202.81,"end":208.77,"text":"That particular vehicle built a three-dimensional picture of its surroundings using video cameras","words":[["That",202.81,203.13],["particular",203.13,203.53],["vehicle",203.53,204.03],["built",204.03,204.37],["a",204.37,204.53],["three",204.53,204.83],["-dimensional",204.83,205.39],["picture",205.39,205.97],["of",205.97,206.25],["its",206.25,206.39],["surroundings",206.39,206.95],["using",206.95,207.81],["video",207.81,208.29],["cameras",208.29,208.77]]},{"start":208.77,"end":209.55,"text":"and lasers.","words":[["and",208.77,209.15],["lasers.",209.15,209.55]]},{"start":210.49,"end":216.45,"text":"It was equipped with seven laptop computers which analyzed the incoming information","words":[["It",210.49,210.85],["was",210.85,211.05],["equipped",211.05,211.35],["with",211.35,211.93],["seven",211.93,212.53],["laptop",212.53,212.99],["computers",212.99,213.61],["which",213.61,214.41],["analyzed",214.41,214.97],["the",214.97,215.29],["incoming",215.29,215.77],["information",215.77,216.45]]},{"start":216.45,"end":223.35,"text":"10 times a second, and it drove along at a comfortable 55 kilometers per hour.","words":[["10",216.45,216.95],["times",216.95,217.57],["a",217.57,217.77],["second,",217.77,218.13],["and",218.87,219.07],["it",219.07,219.19],["drove",219.19,219.51],["along",219.51,219.99],["at",219.99,220.63],["a",220.63,220.71],["comfortable",220.71,221.19],["55",221.19,222.11],["kilometers",222.11,222.65],["per",222.65,223.05],["hour.",223.05,223.35]]},{"start":224.37,"end":229.91,"text":"The design details have been published, so we hope to learn from them and go on to make","words":[["The",224.37,224.73],["design",224.73,225.13],["details",225.13,225.55],["have",225.55,225.91],["been",225.91,226.03],["published,",226.03,226.47],["so",226.73,227.09],["we",227.09,227.29],["hope",227.29,227.43],["to",227.43,227.61],["learn",227.61,227.91],["from",227.91,228.23],["them",228.23,228.47],["and",228.47,229.15],["go",229.15,229.37],["on",229.37,229.57],["to",229.57,229.73],["make",229.73,229.91]]},{"start":229.91,"end":232.89,"text":"ours even better for next year's competition.","words":[["ours",229.91,230.33],["even",230.33,230.91],["better",230.91,231.33],["for",231.33,231.63],["next",231.63,231.95],["year's",231.95,232.43],["competition.",232.43,232.89]]},{"start":234.65,"end":240.69,"text":"The competition is open to all universities, and there's a prize of $2 million for the","words":[["The",234.65,235.01],["competition",235.01,235.37],["is",235.37,235.95],["open",235.95,236.19],["to",236.19,236.41],["all",236.41,236.69],["universities,",236.69,237.27],["and",237.53,237.65],["there's",237.65,237.85],["a",237.85,237.99],["prize",237.99,238.41],["of",238.41,239.05],["$2",239.05,239.45],["million",239.45,239.87],["for",239.87,240.59],["the",240.59,240.69]]},{"start":240.69,"end":240.95,"text":"winner.","words":[["winner.",240.69,240.95]]},{"start":241.45,"end":243.29,"text":"But it's really about more than that.","words":[["But",241.45,241.85],["it's",241.85,242.15],["really",242.15,242.47],["about",242.47,242.69],["more",242.69,242.95],["than",242.95,243.11],["that.",243.11,243.29]]},{"start":243.29,"end":249.73,"text":"The sponsors are hoping to see innovative design ideas that they can transfer into commercial","words":[["The",243.29,244.31],["sponsors",244.31,244.81],["are",244.81,245.11],["hoping",245.11,245.33],["to",245.33,245.53],["see",245.53,245.73],["innovative",245.73,246.41],["design",246.41,246.85],["ideas",246.85,247.35],["that",247.35,248.09],["they",248.09,248.25],["can",248.25,248.41],["transfer",248.41,248.95],["into",248.95,249.25],["commercial",249.25,249.73]]},{"start":249.73,"end":250.23,"text":"production.","words":[["production.",249.73,250.23]]},{"start"